<https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/ca/CategoryDefinition_5482b8d0> a cdsg:PolicyTargetCategoryStatement,
        cdsg:TargetCategoryTerminologyStatement ;
    rdfs:label "Statistics Canada deference to the Employment Equity Act term"@en ;
    cdsg:appliesInJurisdiction <https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/ca/FederalJurisdiction_1c75a772> ;
    cdsg:hasSourceEvidence <https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/evidence/SourceEvidence_402fb31b> ;
    cdsg:isExpressedIn <https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/ca/StatisticalStandardDocument_c2aaf2bf> ;
    cdsg:sourceStatementText "1. Increasingly, the “visible minority population” is being referred to as the “racialized population” by media, academia and other groups. For 2021, Statistics Canada has chosen to continue to use the term “visible minority” in published data tables and reference materials because this is the term currently used by the federal Employment Equity Act. 4"@en .

<https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/ca/CategoryDefinition_c224e635> a cdsg:NormativeTargetCategoryDefinition,
        cdsg:PolicyTargetCategoryStatement ;
    rdfs:label "Definition of members of visible minorities, Employment Equity Act s. 3"@en ;
    cdsg:appliesInJurisdiction <https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/ca/FederalJurisdiction_1c75a772> ;
    cdsg:definesTargetCategory <https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/target/source/category-c224e635> ;
    cdsg:hasSourceEvidence <https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/evidence/SourceEvidence_f2fced91> ;
    cdsg:isExpressedIn <https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/ca/Statute_c0d7710a> ;
    cdsg:sourceStatementText "members of visible minorities means persons, other than Aboriginal peoples, who are non-Caucasian in race or non-white in colour; (minorités visibles)"@en .

<https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/ca/CategoryDefinition_dd6fa091> a cdsg:NormativeTargetCategoryDefinition,
        cdsg:PolicyTargetCategoryStatement ;
    rdfs:label "Definition of designated groups, Employment Equity Act s. 3"@en ;
    cdsg:appliesInJurisdiction <https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/ca/FederalJurisdiction_1c75a772> ;
    cdsg:definesTargetCategory <https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/target/source/category-dd6fa091> ;
    cdsg:hasSourceEvidence <https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/evidence/SourceEvidence_2719e747> ;
    cdsg:isExpressedIn <https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/ca/Statute_c0d7710a> ;
    cdsg:sourceStatementText "designated groups means women, Aboriginal peoples, persons with disabilities and members of visible minorities; (groupes désignés)"@en .

<https://w3id.org/cdsg/resource/ca/CategoryDefinition_ee4f68c7> a cdsg:NormativeTargetCategoryDefinition,
        cdsg:PolicyTargetCategoryStatement ;
    rdfs:label "Definition of aboriginal peoples of Canada, Constitution Act 1982 s. 35(2)"@en ;
